[style name="bwuh"]
MC (neutral): I wonder who'll come in today~
[style name="no_portrait"]
...[pause=0.3][b]The doorbell jingles.[/b]
[style name="bwuh"]
MC (smile): Right on cue-
MC (neutral): ...?
MC (neutral_closed): ...
MC (neutral): [i]*peeks down*[/i]
MC (happy): There you are!
MC (neutral_closed): (Not gonna fall for the same trick twice!)
LK (neutral): Good morning...
MC (smile): Welcome. Did something happen to your laptop again?
LK (sad): Yeah...
label diagnose_intro
- What happened to it?
	MC: What happened to it?
	LK (frown): It's hot and the fans are loud again... and there's so much...
	MC (neutral): ?? So much of what?
	LK (sad): ads... and pop-ups...
- Did you do something to it?
	MC (neutral): (Let me hear what's wrong first.)
	jump diagnose_intro
MC (neutral): Do you know how this happened?
LK (sad): I think it was the game...
MC (neutral): What game was it?
LK (sad): It was the new game that got really popular... every single one of my friends got it, and I wanted to play with them...
MC (neutral): So it turned out like this after you installed it?
LK (sad): Yeah...
MC (neutral_closed): Hmm... Where did you get your copy of the game?
LK (sad): It was a website...
MC (neutral): Official website?
LK (sad): ...
LK (sad): No....
LK (frown): I can't buy the game... so I-
MC (smile): Alright. I get it. You don't have to tell me.
label diagnose_choice
MC: (It's definitely...)
- Malware
	jump diagnose_correct
- Bloatware
	MC (frown): (wait, is it?...)
	LK (sad): Mister..?
	set {Global.current_day_score} -= 20
	[signal arg="wrong_diagnosis"]
	if {Global.current_day_score} <= 0:
		jump diagnose_failed
	jump diagnose_choice
- System Failure
	MC (frown): (wait, is it?...)
	LK (sad): Mister..?
	set {Global.current_day_score} -= 20
	[signal arg="wrong_diagnosis"]
	if {Global.current_day_score} <= 0:
		jump diagnose_failed
	jump diagnose_choice
label diagnose_failed
LK (sad): Mister, I need to go now...
MC (sad): (I'm not quite myself today...)
[signal arg="day_failed"]
jump timeline_end
label diagnose_correct
MC (neutral): You were right, the "game" you downloaded is most likely the culprit.
MC (smile): Well, I'll get rid of it for you.
LK (neutral): Okay.
[signal arg="start_minigames"]
label timeline_end
